# oracle: neighbor nsq in a triclinic box with pairs exactly at the 8.0 cutoff
units real
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 4.0
region box prism 0 3 0 3 0 3 0.5 0.3 0.2
create_box 2 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 39.948
mass 2 83.798
pair_style lj/cut 8.0
pair_coeff 1 1 0.238 3.405
pair_coeff 2 2 0.317 3.6
pair_coeff 1 2 0.275 3.5
thermo_style custom step pe press
thermo_modify format float %.15g
neighbor 2.0 nsq
run 0
